flowchart TD
  B[Behaviourism<br/>Skinner] --> B1[Instant feedback on every click and item]
  B --> B2[Tiers shape recall, then apply, then analyse]
  C[Cognitivism<br/>Sweller, Mayer] --> C1[One traversal order at a time]
  C --> C2[Worked example before practice]
  C --> C3[Node, breadcrumb and output on one screen]
  K[Constructivism<br/>Piaget, Bruner] --> K1[Predict the next visit before it is shown]
  K --> K2[Sandbox tree building]
  S[Social cognitive theory<br/>Bandura] --> S1[Narrated tutor models the procedure]
  S --> S2[Mastery badges and not-yet framing]
  V[Scaffolding in the ZPD<br/>Vygotsky] --> V1[Hints and breadcrumb fade with success]
  V --> V2[Remediation only on a missed objective]
